WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.173
The read needs two permissions, each
the least privileged for its call:

2
00:00:04.173 --> 00:00:08.225
audit log read for the directory
audits, and the Lifecycle Workflows

3
00:00:08.225 --> 00:00:11.850
reports read permission for a
workflow's processing results.

4
00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:16.294
Both come from Microsoft Graph,
on the endpoint for your cloud,

5
00:00:16.294 --> 00:00:20.737
and both APIs are listed for the
US Government L4 and L5 clouds.

6
00:00:20.737 --> 00:00:25.025
Lifecycle Workflows is available
in Azure for US Government.

7
00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:28.722
The card system's and Intune's
records arrive as exports;

8
00:00:28.722 --> 00:00:30.860
the code reads neither service.
